<div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ad968ac8-ff2f-4320-b335-97819cfca52c" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1">
<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]">
<div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling">
<p data-start="77" data-end="667" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">The Soulflex TPE Eco-Friendly Yoga Mat offers soft cushioning and reliable grip for yoga, Pilates, stretching, and home workouts. Made from premium TPE, it protects your joints while keeping you stable with its textured, non-slip surface. The sweat-resistant, anti-tear construction helps the mat stay clean, durable, and long-lasting even with regular use. Lightweight and easy to carry, it’s suitable for all ages and fitness levels. With its eco-friendly, non-toxic materials, this mat supports both your practice and the environment, making it a dependable choice for everyday training.</p>
</div>
